    <section class=3D"block" id=3D"quality">
      <h2>5. Code quality assessment</h2>
      <div class=3D"two">
        <div class=3D"card">
          <h3 style=3D"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14.5px">Structure</h3>
          <p style=3D"font-size:14px;margin:0">~2,850 lines added across 15=
 new analytics/metadata modules plus 5 modified files. Module boundaries ar=
e single-purpose and consistent with the pre-existing Phase 1 style =E2=80=
=94 one file per analytical concern. Duplication found (P2 items above) is =
minor and contained, not large-scale copy-paste drift.</p>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"card">
          <h3 style=3D"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14.5px">The one structural =
gap that matters</h3>
          <p style=3D"font-size:14px;margin:0"><b>No automated test suite e=
xists anywhere in this repository</b>, across either phase. Every validatio=
n to date =E2=80=94 including this audit =E2=80=94 has been a manual, one-t=
ime pass: <code style=3D"font-size:12.5px">node --check</code>, live API qu=
eries, Playwright walkthroughs. Nothing catches a future silent regression =
in DCF, risk or correlation math. This is the highest-leverage maintainabil=
ity fix available, and cheap: the core math modules are pure functions with=
 no I/O.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"card">
        <h3 style=3D"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14.5px">Error handling</h3>
        <p style=3D"font-size:14px;margin:0">Consistent throughout: every p=
rovider-level fetch degrades to null/cached/"unavailable" rather than throw=
ing into a broken UI state =E2=80=94 verified live across every edge case i=
n this audit (negative FCF, failed fetches, empty/single-stock/concentrated=
 portfolios). No exceptions escaped to a 500 or a blank page in any test ru=
n this session.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

