=80=94 this is a check for density, label and color consistency within the =
existing structure, not a redesign review.</p>
      <ul class=3D"plain">
        <li><b>Tier badges / info-icon popovers</b> =E2=80=94 render correc=
tly, keyboard-focusable, consistently placed next to column headers and car=
